run.sh, run_nr.sh, run_r.sh and multirun*.sh find the executables in
build/bin of the CMake build of this tree, or in $ONCVPSP_BIN_DIR.  The
*_test.sh scripts and nist_test.py are run by ctest (tests/CMakeLists.txt).

psp8_kernel_diff.py and ref_patch.py are for changes of the reference
outputs (doc/developer_setup.md, Tests).

The first line of fldiff.pl may have to be edited to specify the proper
location of perl.

reindent.py re-indents the Fortran sources in the layout of
doc/coding_standards.md; pre-commit runs it, and with --stdin an editor
can run it as a formatter (doc/developer_setup.md).
